 place blueprints or free build. Harvest resources, assign villager roles, and expand!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track food, resources, and economies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build barracks and command armies\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off raids from Void and Hostile Factions\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1775762517\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RPG Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/b680fc33ab358db05c830290fdcd833d.poster.avif?t=1775762517\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/b680fc33ab358db05c830290fdcd833d.webm?t=1775762517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/b680fc33ab358db05c830290fdcd833d.mp4?t=1775762517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between one of 5 classes, each with its own equipment and skill tree based on which elemental Dynasty you choose. Character creation allows you to mix and match styles with each class, and Dynasty.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class specific progression and equipment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental combo mixing through gear\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sub class variants within regional districts\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i