ct biomes. Planets spawn dozens of continents for the player to discover, each with a unique seed.\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes are limited in size, except for the infinite ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traveling ocean borders by ship can cue new continents\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome has its own flora, fauna, and environmental profile\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1775762517\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.poster.avif?t=1775762517\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.webm?t=1775762517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.mp4?t=1775762517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will command your units to defeat enemy armies, and fight alongisde a permanent retinue. Play with up to 5 friends in locally hosted co - op to create an empire together and share your Dynasty traits.</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Is optional, players get the same content offline\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI units include small groups to large battalions\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third party server support for larger private hosting\u00a0</p></